Descriptor ResidencyStatus
    documentation 'This descriptor defines indications of the location of a person's legal 
    'residence relative to (within or outside of) the boundaries of the public school 
    'attended and its administrative unit. 
    with optional map type
        item Resident of administrative unit and usual school attendance area
        item Resident of administrative unit, but of other school attendance area
        item Resident of this state, but not of this administrative unit
        item Resident of an administrative unit that crosses state boundaries
        item Resident of another state

